### Handy requests for VS Code (REST Client extension) or Visual Studio.
### The signed-in user comes from "DevUser" in src/ServiceDesk.API/appsettings.json
### (Role: Employee | ServiceDeskAgent | ServiceDeskManager | Administrator). Restart the API after changing it.

@host = https://localhost:7100

### 1. (Administrator) create a service routed to the IT queue (id 2)
POST {{host}}/api/services
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "VPN access", "description": "Cannot connect to the VPN", "categoryId": 1, "defaultPriority": "High", "defaultQueueId": 2 }

### 2. (Administrator/Manager) add agent 5 to the IT queue
POST {{host}}/api/queues/2/members
Content-Type: application/json

{ "agentEmployeeId": 5 }

### 3. (Employee) create a ticket
POST {{host}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "VPN fails on login", "description": "Error 809 since this morning", "serviceItemId": 1, "priority": "High" }

### 4. (Employee) my tickets, filtered
GET {{host}}/api/tickets?status=New&priority=High&search=VPN&page=1&pageSize=20

### 5. (Agent/Manager) unassigned tickets
GET {{host}}/api/tickets/unassigned

### 6. (Manager) assign ticket 1 to agent 5      (as an Agent with EmployeeId 5 you can assign it to yourself)
POST {{host}}/api/tickets/1/assign
Content-Type: application/json

{ "agentEmployeeId": 5, "note": "Please take this" }

### 7. (Agent) start work
POST {{host}}/api/tickets/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "newStatus": "InProgress" }

### 8. (Agent) internal note (employees never see it)
POST {{host}}/api/tickets/1/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "body": "Checked the gateway logs, looks like an expired certificate", "isInternal": true }

### 9. (Agent) ask the employee for information
POST {{host}}/api/tickets/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "newStatus": "WaitingForUser", "note": "Please send a screenshot of the error" }

### 10. (Employee) reply - the ticket returns to InProgress automatically
POST {{host}}/api/tickets/1/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "body": "Screenshot attached", "isInternal": false }

### 11. (Agent) resolve - the note is required
POST {{host}}/api/tickets/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "newStatus": "Resolved", "note": "Renewed the certificate on the gateway" }

### 12. (Employee) not fixed? reopen within the window
POST {{host}}/api/tickets/1/reopen
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Still cannot connect" }

### 13. (Agent/Manager) escalate to the Finance queue (id 4) ... or to manager 99 with { "managerEmployeeId": 99, ... }
POST {{host}}/api/tickets/1/escalate
Content-Type: application/json

{ "targetQueueId": 4, "reason": "Needs the finance team" }

### 14. (Manager) workload per agent
GET {{host}}/api/agents/workload

### 15. history of a ticket
GET {{host}}/api/tickets/1/history

### 16. attachments: use Swagger to upload (multipart field "file"), then:
GET {{host}}/api/tickets/1/attachments
